WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:07,070
Leave the blood spirit behind and spare your life

2
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:09,070
I'll give it to you when you catch up

3
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:16,010
Did it leave a spiritual mark?

4
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,010
Yes, but he flew out of the peach forest

5
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,010
I can't feel it anymore

6
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:22,010
It's all my fault that you came back too late

7
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:24,010
You gave us the wrong direction, so we were left in the dark.

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:26,010
The king bee also led him to the blood spirit

9
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,140
You take away the elite

10
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,140
How dare you blame me now

11
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,700
Blood Spirit is gone

12
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:34,700
Want to advance to the next level

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:39,980
We can only hold on and take risks

14
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,140
Can't hold it

15
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:48,360
Sure enough, it's restricted

16
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:50,360
Otherwise, the Lord of Taolin would have chased him out long ago.

17
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:54,860
Energy accumulation completed

18
00:00:54,860 --> 00:01:00,310
Is it advanced?

19
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:01,310
I'm not a butterfly

20
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:02,310
What's the solution?
